l garantit le versement de vos loyers, que le logement soit occupé ou non.\n3. ContactPour toute information complémentaire concernant ce bien, veuillez contacter Acumen Patrimoine.\nTéléphone : 01 41 55 12 20\nEmail : info@acumenpatrimoine.fr","addr":"2 Rue du Capitaine Alfred Dreyfus","gal":["https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6IjU1OTNkZGIyMWM5ODRiNTRjYjNkNTU4MTRlMDhhZTgzYTJlYWE4ZWUiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiI3ZTgwMzQ2OGJiY2MzZGQxNDliYmE3OGFjYzYxNWU0ZCJ9?signature=b561126e7bed5ce4021f5323d72bf18e7e9942b6746bb5c84719786052a8b7cc","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6Ijg4ZDM0ZjVjZmEzM2Y5NTdjY2FlNjQ4Nzk4ODY2YTdjOTYzOThmNjkiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiJjOGRlYmY4NjFmMjgxNjEyY2QyOWEwZTVjNWE2MDljMSJ9?signature=6ef122a68f7c9509588ab63decf1ef8ae84306c821abe3d61b8ea942e53d2207","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6ImU1NTM5Y2I0MzQ2ZjNiZTk4YzI0MDU0YjA5NmIwYmJhMjg3YmEwMDciLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiI4NjZjZmFkNTEzNTBmYTRlMzU5MDc4OWZjNDYzMTg1OCJ9?signature=0a0c17d15c30c8a95b79a48cbbfbacb6332ddcf825550d4ea526dd59c8d5b0a4","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6IjBhNzdkNzk2YzdkZTNmMjY3Y2M2MzRiNmE0MmVkYmI0YWM5MjdiMzYiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiJiYzU4MmM1MTU5YjM2Y2Q3YWQzYzMxY2JiZTUzNDRkNyJ9?signature=994fd07d61791ed1ad75b9bc97298274169a868793974c8a470e5bf1c363b1a6","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6ImQ2YmVlNjE0NGI4MDA5OTZmMTNmZGY2MTUxY2Y2ZDg2YmU5MmIyN2IiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Iml